  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Amongst the following, the number of species having the linear shape is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>XeF</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>BeCl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>BCl</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8854;</mo></msubsup></math></p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><br />Using VSEPR theory, following are the shapes: <img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0092_1c85bb32be8e.png\" style=\"width: 600px; height: 317px;\" /></p><p>Thus,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>XeF</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>BeCl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;have linear structure.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"
